! interfaces.d/eth2/ingress/5.acl: what may arrive on an access port that is
! not IP. A MAC list sees only non-IP frames (IPv4 and IPv6 pass it), as on
! IOS; give it an IP list too in the same file for those.
mac access-list extended PORT-L2
 permit any any 0x0806 0x0
 permit any host 0180.c200.0000
 deny any any log
